        "Id1": {
            "text": "Construction on Alan B Miller Hall began on March 30th, 2007. The building was designed by Robert A. M. Stern. Alan B Miller Hall is located on 101 Ukrop Way in Williamsburg, Virginia, United States. The current tenant is the Mason School of Business."
        },
